Z||000003||Monkeyman||11-08-2001||02:09 AM||||I have a set of Aus' door speaker pods.  They're great!  I just ran 3 good sized screws through the back of the door panel into the back of the speaker pod.  I haven't had any problems with the pods loosening yet.  If you're big and fat like me, you have to be sure not to kick them when you're exiting the car (can't get my legs up as far as some).  I think they only come in gray, but it's textured and can easily be painted.  The next time I remove my door panels, I plan on painting mine black to match the doors.  I have a stick and they don't even come close to getting in the way.<P>Two thumbs up. ||||reg||14
